<title>ITALY: Naples airport May cargo traffic up 2.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Naples airport May cargo traffic up 2.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total cargo handled at Naples airport rose 2.8 percent in May compared to the same month last year, the airport authority GESAC said.</p>
<p>		    May 97   Pct change    Jan-May 97  Pct Change</p>
<p>		    tonnes   vs Apr 96	tonnes     Jan-May 96</p>
<p>Cargo Imports</p>
<p>Flown	     161.1    down   0.7	616.4     down  11.1</p>
<p>Trucked	   172.0    down   9.1	876 8     down   9.5</p>
<p>Total	     333.1    down   5.2    1,493.2     down  10.2</p>
<p>Cargo Exports</p>
<p>Flown	     224.1     up   17.7	878.9     down   1.0</p>
<p>Trucked	     0.0    none in 96	  5.5     none in 96</p>
<p>Total	     224.1     up   17.7	884.5     down   0.5</p>
<p>All Cargo</p>
<p>Flown	     385.2     up    9.3    1,495.4     down   5.5</p>
<p>Trucked	   172.0   down    9.1	882.3     down   9.0</p>
<p>Total	     557.2     up    2.8    2,377.7     down   6.8</p>
<p>Total Mail	162.2     up   41.3	814.5	 up  34.9</p>
<p>Total Pax    13,033.0     up   10.3   58,958.0	 up  18.7</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
